## Why This Is Asked

Tests for multi-tenant isolation are foundational for SaaS apps. The goal is to confirm UI and API boundaries prevent cross-tenant data leakage, a common subtle bug.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-tenancy data isolation
- Role-based access control (RBAC)
- Deterministic fixtures for repeatable runs
- UI vs API boundary testing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Cypress skeleton for tenant isolation
describe('Tenant isolation', () => {
  beforeEach(() => {
    seedTenants(['A','B']);
  });
  it('creates user in A and enforces isolation', () => {
    cy.visit('/login');
    cy.login('adminA','A');
    cy.visit('/admin/users');
    cy.get('[data-cy=create-user]').click();
    cy.get('[data-cy=username]').type('newuser');
    cy.get('[data-cy=save]').click();
    cy.contains('newuser').should('exist');
    cy.request({method:'GET', url:'/api/users?tenant=A'}).then(resp => {
      expect(resp.body.some(u => u.username==='newuser')).to.be.true;
    });
    cy.request({method:'GET', url:'/api/users?tenant=B'}).then(resp => {
      expect(resp.body.some(u => u.username==='newuser')).to.be.false;
    });
  });
});
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you scale this for 100 tenants while keeping tests fast?
- How would you handle flaky network simulations and ensure determinism across runs?

## Why This Is Asked

This question assesses a candidate's understanding of end-to-end testing for multi-step user journeys, including authentication flows, external system mocking, and deterministic test data management. It evaluates practical knowledge of creating reliable, fast, and isolated tests in a real-world SaaS context.

## Key Concepts

- End-to-end testing with authentication and email verification
- Test data seeding and database isolation
- Mocking external services (email delivery, OIDC sign-in)
- Assertions for UI state and created resources
- Time-bounded test design for CI/CD pipelines

## Code Example

```javascript
// Using Playwright
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';

test('complete onboarding flow', async ({ page }) => {
  // Seed deterministic test data
  await seedTestUser({ email: 'demo@test.com', password: 'Test123!' });

  // Mock email service to capture verification link
  await mockEmailService();

  // Mock OIDC provider
  await mockOIDCProvider();

  // Navigate to signup and complete registration
  await page.goto('/signup');
  await page.fill('[name=email]', 'demo@test.com');
  await page.fill('[name=password]', 'Test123!');
  await page.click('[data-testid=signup-submit]');

  // Extract and follow email verification link
  const verifyLink = await getVerificationLink('demo@test.com');
  await page.goto(verifyLink);

  // Complete profile setup
  await page.fill('[name=name]', 'Jane Doe');
  await page.fill('[name=company]', 'Acme Corp');
  await page.click('[data-testid=profile-submit]');

  // Create first workspace
  await page.fill('[name=workspaceName]', 'My Workspace');
  await page.click('[data-testid=create-workspace]');

  // Assert dashboard displays new workspace
  await expect(page.locator('[data-testid=workspace-card]')).toContainText('My Workspace');
});
```

